{"id":"poprostu","lemma":"попросту","pos":"adv","rank":4950,"glosses":["simply, merely, just","simply (without ceremony or embarrassment, easily)","simply. quite simply, plainly (put simply/directly)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1a/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это попросту не работает.","en":"It just doesn't work.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283316","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"}]},{"text":"Сегодня попросту слишком холодно.","en":"It's simply too cold today.","words":[{"g":"today"},null,{"g":"too , too much"},{"g":"coldly"}]},{"text":"Разве жизнь попросту не прекрасна?","en":"Isn't life just great?","words":[{"g":"really"},{"g":"life"},null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Это попросту не в счёт.","en":"It just doesn't count.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"count"}]},{"text":"Ты попросту тратишь без дела своё время.","en":"You're just wasting your time.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to spend, to expend","l":"тратить"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"деть"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"time"}]}]}